        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Cohen... Where are we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew it! *profanity*, I knew it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is where most of the lab ended up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that I think about it, we were too careless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've lived in this town for so long and we had no idea at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's that psycho behind all this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that smell...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What else could it be? That's the smell of death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay frosty. And close.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are these?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cages? So many?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "All corpses... people and beasts together...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the work of Lev Klitschko, a man both mad and cruel beyond imagination. I never should've tried to take him alive. He should have a bullet in his head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your typical madman wouldn't do something this awful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "...There's someone alive in that cage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_158_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look who's here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's that Drudge character.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#4",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd recognize the *profanity* anywhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_158_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, it's you. The mercenaries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm so glad to see you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know we've had our differences in the past... but let's set them aside for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a feeling you're looking for that scientist... and I know where he is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got a common enemy. And the enemy of my enemy is my friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "So brazen I'm sick to my stomach.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_158_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Feline over there, I know you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your skills are pretty easily recognizable. And one can hear a lot in the mercenary market in Columbia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are a killer, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_158_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island hired you, meaning even they have quite some dirty work to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "text": "Compared to others, you must know better how to weigh up the pros and cons. Let's have a talk, shall we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up. Or I can help you with that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_158_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shame. I thought people like you would be more realistic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drudge"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_166",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Open the cage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_166",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_166",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. Just open the cage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_166",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
