    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "A gigantic experimental area, a corner previously kept dark, is bathed in light. At the same time, the visitors all realize why they didn't notice the air when they came in.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The elderly scholar stands behind a thick glass wall, and in front of a huge cultivator. Lev has a grotesque smile on his face, both chilling and unnatural.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "A moment later, the cultivator itself lights up, and reveals a spherical crystal wrapped in connective tissue floating, writhing, twitching.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just in time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... you always come at precisely the right time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
