        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't bother. It's bulletproof glass.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I applaud your decisiveness, squeezing the trigger without hesitation. Don't even wait for an end to our little prologue here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we have a show to put on. A great opening requires a great audience, and a complete opening dialogue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Today is a day of praise for the great work of the Creator. And that Creator is none other than yours truly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Creator? That's quite a title you've given yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a *profanity* psycho!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Psycho... hah. The mediocre always use this word to describe ideas and concepts they cannot understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Behold this world!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Completely different chemistry... totally inverted laws of physics... the flower of science blooms in exploration and doubt. And the most fertile soil lies in the land of the unknown!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now, I have succeeded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you see? Can you feel? The surface appearance is similar, but it all functions on radically different principles!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the evolution of life. This is the iteration of existence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium is the truth of this world. You should accept that. Don't fear it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcome to the future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you have even the slightest moral compunction over what you're doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "What does human life even mean to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Human nature is weak, good and evil are subjective definitions of weakness, and what we call guilt is but one of the myriad cognitive signals produced by the brain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the science I pursue is never swayed by such flimsy concepts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't delude yourselves that even in this world you still bind your minds with these meaningless ideas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even electronic information technology and nuclear energy were originally designed to help us kill each other more effectively.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you add a new layer of definition to science? Force everything to fit your fragile spiritual needs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nonsense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I forgive you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have to understand. I'll allow you to go on, unknowing. Primitive thinking is a common form of ignorance. It's not your fault, and I forgive you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the end of my speech. And in addition to my forgiveness, I also offer you my thanks for waiting so patiently.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now it is time for praise. Give your praise to this entirely new life form.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Praise be! Praise be! Praise be!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
